  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed both as a noun and as a suru verb ({回顧|かいこ}する). Commonly appears in cultural contexts — {回顧|かいこ}{展|てん} (retrospective exhibition) is a standard compound. Also used in {回顧|かいこ}{録|ろく} (memoir, reminiscences).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {回顧|かいこ}{展|てん}: retrospective exhibition\n- {回顧|かいこ}{録|ろく}: memoir, reminiscences\n- {過去|かこ}を{回顧|かいこ}する: to look back on the past\n- {一年|いちねん}を{回顧|かいこ}する: to look back on the year",
